1
00:00:00,621 --> 00:00:03,161
(Leonard:)-You ready to go?
-Yep. Hey, and maybe this time,

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:06,130
(Penny:)you don't try and talk sports
with the guys.

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,100
(Leonard:)Some sports bar.

4
00:00:08,162 --> 00:00:10,002
(Leonard:)It's like they never
even heard of Quidditch.

5
00:00:10,998 --> 00:00:12,308
(Leonard:)Do we really have to go?

6
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:14,383
(Penny:)Oh, come on. Every time we're
about to hang out with my friends,

7
00:00:14,502 --> 00:00:15,602
(Penny:)you don't want to.

8
00:00:15,669 --> 00:00:18,149
It's like, "It's too loud,"
or "The bathroom's too dirty,"

9
00:00:18,272 --> 00:00:20,942
or "They put a chicken wing
in my ear." I mean...

10
00:00:22,143 --> 00:00:23,813
Well, you're right.
Let's just go.

11
00:00:23,878 --> 00:00:26,378
(Penny:)-Hey, what's going on with you?
-Nothing, I'm fine.

12
00:00:27,114 --> 00:00:29,784
(Penny:)All right, hang on.
Is this still about your mom's book?

13
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:32,300
(Leonard:)No. Not everything is about my mom.

14
00:00:32,319 --> 00:00:34,629
'Cause if you're still upset
about that, we don't have to go.

15
00:00:34,688 --> 00:00:36,828
(Leonard:)Except this is totally about my mom.

16
00:00:38,692 --> 00:00:41,172
(Penny:)I'm so sorry.
I never should have read that book.

17
00:00:41,228 --> 00:00:43,468
(Penny:)You know what? You want to just get
dinner and watch the game here?

18
00:00:44,198 --> 00:00:46,148
(Leonard:)-That sounds nice.
-Okay.

19
00:00:46,667 --> 00:00:48,407
(Leonard:)Or, you know, we could get take-out

20
00:00:48,536 --> 00:00:49,916
(Leonard:)and watch the Blu-ray
extended version

21
00:00:50,004 --> 00:00:55,024
(Leonard:)of The Hobbit movie
with commentary track.

